{"ticker":{"symbol":"APMD","name":"Apnimed, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":21.51,"change_pct":-0.04569653948535923,"market_cap":895478080.0,"pe":3.7604897,"pb":-0.5862633,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":16.12,"week52_high":35.29,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","city":"Cambridge","employees":81,"website":"https://apnimed.com","business_summary":"Apnimed, Inc. operates as a clinical pharmaceutical company that develops and manufactures novel oral therapies that address the neurobiology of sleep-related breathing diseases in global markets. It offers AD109, an oral therapy designed to treat obstructive sleep apnea (OSA) by targeting the underlying neuromuscular dysfunction. The company was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","business_summary_ko":"Apnimed, Inc.는 글로벌 시장에서 수면 관련 호흡 질환의 신경생물학을 다루는 새로운 경구 치료법을 개발 및 제조하는 임상 제약 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 근본적인 신경근 기능 장애를 표적으로 삼아 폐쇄성 수면 무호흡증(OSA)을 치료하도록 고안된 경구 치료제인 AD109를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2017년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠주 케임브리지에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2024","revenue":8012000.0,"operating_income":-114234000.0,"net_income":-111305000.0,"eps":-3.870107},{"period":"2025","revenue":38467000.0,"operating_income":-53818000.0,"net_income":-932000.0,"eps":-0.03}],"price_history":[],"analyst":{"n_analysts":3,"rating":"","strong_buy":0,"buy":4,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strong_sell":0,"target_mean":50.33333,"target_high":60.0,"target_low":41.0,"recent_actions":["2026-08-25 LifeSci Capital: Outperform 신규, 목표 50","2026-08-25 Cantor Fitzgerald: Overweight 신규, 목표 60","2026-08-25 Evercore ISI Group: Outperform 신규","2026-08-25 B of A Securities: Buy 신규, 목표 41"],"summary":""},"news":[{"title":"앱니메드 APMD(APNIMED INC) | 적정주가","publisher":"초이스스탁US","link":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE1lVnEtSXEzZHlFSUlWWnMxVTNRUnlqcVllSkNEaGxpeVVhSmRYbFo1MnhpMFlkYU81bWhsZ0RiSWZGVjFDUkdHY0hyNElBMi1aNmJEaExnaVpTZXp1UVppMw?oc=5","date":"